# Model artifacts (large files)
# NOTE: `*.pt` / `rnn_meta_controller.pt` are intentionally left tracked (commented out):
# the reference weights under models/ are consumed by
# tests/integration/test_deployed_models.py and must exist on fresh clones/CI.
# They are stored via Git LFS (.gitattributes routes *.pt/*.safetensors through LFS).
# Sizes recorded by the LFS pointers: hrm_production.pt ~742 MB, trm_production.pt
# ~744 MB, mcts_production.pt ~0.9 MB, meta_production.pt ~0.18 MB,
# rnn_meta_controller.pt ~0.06 MB — the two large ones are a Phase 8b decision
# (untrack vs slim); do not assume they are all small.
# Large or generated weights belong under artifacts/ (ignored below).
# *.pt
*.pth
*.h5
*.onnx
# rnn_meta_controller.pt
rnn_meta_controller.history.json
artifacts/

